* Variables: ['W_nfet_g0', 'W_nfet_g1', 'C1', 'C2', 'C3', 'Chr', 'Chi']
* Trial values (midpoint): [1.47, 1.47, 1e-13, 5e-13, 1e-13, 1e-12, 1e-12]
* Metrics: ['avg_power', 'vout_swing', 'rise_time', 'fall_time', 'fom']
* Class: mosfet_analog_tran
* FOM: 1.218952395308486e-11
